title Order lifecycle

Order created [shape: oval, icon: shopping-cart]
Payment method [shape: diamond]
Cash on delivery [icon: dollar-sign]
Online payment pending [icon: clock]
Webhook result [shape: diamond]
Paid [icon: check-circle, color: green]
Payment failed [icon: x-circle, color: red]
Expired after 15 minutes [icon: timer, color: red]
Placed [icon: package]
Packed [icon: box]
Shipped [icon: truck]
Out for delivery [icon: map-pin]
Delivered [icon: check, color: green]
Cancelled [shape: oval, icon: x, color: red]
Deleted [shape: oval, icon: trash]

Order created > Payment method
Payment method > Cash on delivery: COD
Payment method > Online payment pending: UPI or card
Cash on delivery > Placed
Online payment pending > Webhook result
Webhook result > Paid: succeeded
Webhook result > Payment failed: failed
Payment failed > Online payment pending: customer retries
Online payment pending > Expired after 15 minutes: unpaid
Payment failed > Expired after 15 minutes: unpaid
Expired after 15 minutes > Cancelled: stock released
Paid > Placed
Placed > Packed: after 30s or admin
Packed > Shipped: after 90s or admin
Shipped > Out for delivery: after 180s or admin
Out for delivery > Delivered: after 300s or admin
Placed > Cancelled: customer or admin
Packed > Cancelled: customer or admin
Delivered > Deleted: customer deletes
Cancelled > Deleted: customer deletes
